meta {
  name: Members - List
  type: http
  seq: 63
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/members?limit=20&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The members of the community with their role (#1242): owner first, then admins, moderators and members, each by username. Each entry holds cuid, name, username, avatar_url, headline, role and member_since. The headline (#1688) is the line that the member wrote about themselves: empty unless the member shows it (ADR 0020), for every reader, the managers included. Offset pagination (limit, offset). Members of the community only. With a query parameter, the same list is filtered (see Members - Search).
}
